{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/a/ccada11db7b2b90693e2fac4f887a57fce6f96bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7d010bbff66a0c41e43310a51efbaa6bf63396.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> be such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/4/69433f32f3c1bce6f851c5573dcf8000c99e74d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1\\not=x_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/4/43460ff117ac6679fb68dd077ee7b2dfedf4446a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x_i^2-hx_i=b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/c/b6c59bac81580b7f8643a71f076a5c47bae2eba4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i=1, 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/c/87cf8bc498151d722a3b34591ca7468d43e95939.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1+x_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/0/d90ccff6a4fd138e073d6002effacc2323ba639f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } -\\frac{h}{3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }\\frac{h}{3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } \\frac{b}{3} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } 2b \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }-\\frac{b}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"412\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/a/ccada11db7b2b90693e2fac4f887a57fce6f96bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7d010bbff66a0c41e43310a51efbaa6bf63396.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> are the distinct solutions to the quadratic <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/6/c865c0567accd84855d3af31fd8fcab37cea3c0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x^2-hx-b=0$\" width=\"133\" height=\"15\" />. By Vieta, the sum of the roots of this quadratic is the negation of the coefficient of the linear term divided by the coefficient of the quadratic term, so in this case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/d/8cd3b425a75430e2bc197892a5d77cc6ef390ae5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{-h}{3}=\\frac{h}{3}, \\boxed{\\text{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"113\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1974 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1974\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974